  "deleteID": null,
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Can VRChat please fix their in-game reporting system? There are many reports against serious behavior that devs/mods aren't receiving because people would explain everything they need to within the report, only to get a pop up saying \"hey, type that all over again plus more in a new form\" which people usually don't do because it's tedious and unnecessary. They already explained thoroughly within the in-game report, and they don't want to be redirected elsewhere to do it again and fill out the rest of a form. The only time in my entirety of playing VRChat that the in-game reporting system functioned as it should, is very recently with the increase of data bots joining public servers and leaving. I block and report, and only then does it ever go through. If vrc made people fill a form to report those too, for each and every one they encounter, I think many people would pass on that. But there are people getting away because nobody wants to be redirected to fill out a whole form for every person. Let the in-game reporting work.",
